'>{}</span>", "ja483:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja483:19.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja483:20.1": "<p class='endsection'>{}</p>", "ja483:21.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja483:22.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja483:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja483:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja483:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja483:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja483:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja483:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja483:0.4": "10. Sarabhamigajātaka ", "ja483:1.1": "“Āsīsetheva puriso, ", "ja483:1.2": "na nibbindeyya paṇḍito; ", "ja483:1.3": "Passāmi vohaṁ attānaṁ, ", "ja483:1.4": "yathā icchiṁ tathā ahu. ", "ja483:2.1": "Āsīsetheva puriso, ", "ja483:2.2": "na nibbindeyya paṇḍito; ", "ja483:2.3": "Passāmi vohaṁ attānaṁ, ", "ja483:2.4": "udakā thalamubbhataṁ. ", "ja483:3.1": "Vāyametheva puriso, ", "ja483:3.2": "na nibbindeyya paṇḍito; ", "ja483:3.3": "Passāmi vohaṁ attānaṁ, ", "ja483:3.4": "yathā icchiṁ tathā ahu. ", "ja483:4.1": "Vāyametheva puriso, ", "ja483:4.2": "na nibbindeyya paṇḍito; ", "ja483:4.3": "Passāmi vohaṁ attānaṁ, ", "ja483:4.4": "udakā thalamubbhataṁ. ", "ja483:5.1": "Dukkhūpanītopi naro sapañño, ", "ja483:5.2": "Āsaṁ na chindeyya sukhāgamāya; ", "ja483:5.3": "Bahū hi phassā ahitā hitā ca, ", "ja483:5.4": "Avitakkitā maccamupabbajanti. ", "ja483:6.1": "Acintitampi bhavati, ", "ja483:6.2": "cintitampi vinassati; ", "ja483:6.3": "Na hi cintāmayā bhogā, ", "ja483:6.4": "itthiyā purisassa vā”. ", "ja483:7.1": "“Sarabhaṁ giriduggasmiṁ, ", "ja483:7.2": "yaṁ tvaṁ anusarī pure; ", "ja483:7.3": "Alīnacittassa tuvaṁ, ", "ja483:7.4": "vikkantamanujīvasi. ", "ja483:8.1": "Yo taṁ viduggā narakā samuddhari, ", "ja483:8.2": "Silāya yoggaṁ sarabho karitvā; ", "ja483:8.3": "Dukkhūpanītaṁ maccumukhā pamocayi, ", "ja483:8.4": "Alīnacittaṁ ta migaṁ vadesi”. ", "ja483:9.1": "“Kiṁ tvaṁ nu tattheva tadā ahosi, ", "ja483:9.2": "Udāhu te koci naṁ etadakkhā; ", "ja483:9.3": "Vivaṭṭacchaddo nusi sabbadassī, ", "ja483:9.4": "Ñāṇaṁ nu te brāhmaṇa bhiṁsarūpaṁ”. ", "ja483:10.1": "“Na cevahaṁ tattha tadā ahosiṁ, ", "ja483:10.2": "Na cāpi me koci naṁ etadakkhā; ", "ja483:10.3": "Gāthāpadānañca subhāsitānaṁ, ", "ja483:10.4": "Atthaṁ tadānenti janinda dhīrā”. ", "ja483:11.1": "“Ādāya pattiṁ paraviriyaghātiṁ, ", "ja483:11.2": "Cāpe saraṁ kiṁ vicikicchase tuvaṁ; ", "ja483:11.3": "Nunno saro sarabhaṁ hantu khippaṁ, ", "ja483:11.4": "Annañhi etaṁ varapañña rañño”. ", "ja483:12.1": "“Addhā pajānāmi ahampi etaṁ, ", "ja483:12.2": "Annaṁ migo brāhmaṇa khattiyassa; ", "ja483:12.3": "Pubbe katañca apacāyamāno, ", "ja483:12.4": "Tasmā migaṁ sarabhaṁ no hanāmi”. ", "ja483:13.1": "“Neso migo mahārāja, ", "ja483:13.2": "asureso disampati; ", "ja483:13.3": "Etaṁ hantvā manussinda, ", "ja483:13.4": "bhavassu amarādhipo. ", "ja483:14.1": "Sace ca rājā vicikicchase tuvaṁ, ", "ja483:14.2": "Hantuṁ migaṁ sarabhaṁ sahāyakaṁ; ", "ja483:14.3": "Saputtadāro naravīraseṭṭha, ", "ja483:14.4": "Gantā tuvaṁ vetaraṇiṁ yamassa”. ", "ja483:15.1": "“Kāmaṁ ahaṁ jānapadā ca sabbe, ", "ja483:15.2": "Puttā ca dārā ca sahāyasaṅghā; ", "ja483:15.3": "Gacchemu taṁ vetaraṇiṁ yamassa, ", "ja483:15.4": "Na tveva hañño mama pāṇado yo. ", "ja483:16.1": "Ayaṁ migo kicchagatassa mayhaṁ, ", "ja483:16.2": "Ekassa kattā vivanasmi ghore; ", "ja483:16.3": "Taṁ tādisaṁ pubbakiccaṁ saranto, ", "ja483:16.4": "Jānaṁ mahābrahme kathaṁ haneyyaṁ”. ", "ja483:17.1": "“Mittābhirādhī cirameva jīva, ", "ja483:17.2": "Rajjaṁ imaṁ dhammaguṇe pasāsa; ", "ja483:17.3": "Nārīgaṇehi paricāriyanto, ", "ja483:17.4": "Modassu raṭṭhe tidiveva vāsavo. ", "ja483:18.1": "Akkodhano niccapasannacitto, ", "ja483:18.2": "Sabbātithī yācayogo bhavitvā; ", "ja483:18.3": "Datvā ca bhutvā ca yathānubhāvaṁ, ", "ja483:18.4": "Anindito saggamupehi ṭhānan”ti. ", "ja483:19.1": "Sarabhamigajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja483:20.1": "Terasakanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja483:21.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja483:22.1": "Varaamba kuṭhāri sahaṁsavaro, ", "ja483:22.2": "Atharaññasmiṁ dūtakapañcamako; ", "ja483:22.3": "Atha bodhi akitti sutakkarinā, ", "ja483:22.4": "Atha rurumigenaparo sarabhoti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja483:0.1": "", "ja483:0.2": "", "ja483:0.3": "", "ja483:0.4": "", "ja483:1.1": "Āsīsetheva → āsiṁsetheva (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja483:1.2": "", "ja483:1.3": "naṁ → taṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja483:1.4": "", "ja483:2.1": "", "ja483:2.2": "", "ja483:2.3": "naṁ → taṁ (mr) ", "ja483:2.4": "", "ja483:3.1": "", "ja483:3.2": "", "ja483:3.3": "", "ja483:3.4": "", "ja483:4.1": "", "ja483:4.2": "", "ja483:4.3": "", "ja483:4.4": "", "ja483:5.1": "", "ja483:5.2": "", "ja483:5.3": "", "ja483:5.4": "maccamupabbajanti → maccumupabbajanti (bj, pts-vp-pli1); maccumupapajjanti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja483:6.1": "", "ja483:6.2": "", "ja483:6.3": "", "ja483:6.4": "", "ja483:7.1": "", "ja483:7.2": "", "ja483:7.3": "", "ja483:7.4": "vikkantamanujīvasi → vikkantaṁ jīvitaṁ labhi (mr) ", "ja483:8.1": "", "ja483:8.2": "", "ja483:8.3": "", "ja483:8.4": "ta migaṁ → tameva (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja483:9.1": "", "ja483:9.2": "", "ja483:9.3": "", "ja483:9.4": "", "ja483:10.1": "", "ja483:10.2": "", "ja483:10.3": "", "ja483:10.4": "", "ja483:11.1": "pattiṁ → pattaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); paṭṭiṁ (mr) ", "ja483:11.2": "", "ja483:11.3": "Nunno → nuṇṇo (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); tuṇṇo (mr) ", "ja483:11.4": "", "ja483:12.1": "", "ja483:12.2": "", "ja483:12.3": "katañca → pubbe ca kataṁ (mr) ", "ja483:12.4": "", "ja483:13.1": "", "ja483:13.2": "", "ja483:13.3": "", "ja483:13.4": "", "ja483:14.1": "rājā → rāja (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja483:14.2": "sahāyakaṁ → sahāyakaṁ me (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja483:14.3": "naravīraseṭṭha → naraviriyaseṭṭha (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja483:14.4": "Gantā → gantvā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja483:15.1": "", "ja483:15.2": "", "ja483:15.3": "", "ja483:15.4": "hañño mama pāṇado yo → hañño yo mamapāṇadassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1); haññe mama pāṇadassa (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja483:16.1": "", "ja483:16.2": "", "ja483:16.3": "", "ja483:16.4": "", "ja483:17.1": "", "ja483:17.2": "Rajjaṁ imaṁ dhammaguṇe → rajjampimaṁ cassa gaṇe (mr) ", "ja483:17.3": "", "ja483:17.4": "", "ja483:18.1": "", "ja483:18.2": "yācayogo bhavitvā → pāhunake karitvā (sya1ed, sya2ed); yācayogo viditvā (mr) ", "ja483:18.3": "", "ja483:18.4": "", "ja483:19.1": "Sarabhamigajātakaṁ → sarabhajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja483:20.1": "", "ja483:21.1": "", "ja483:22.1": "", "ja483:22.2": "", "ja483:22.3": "", "ja483:22.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja483:0.1": "", "ja483:0.2": "", "ja483:0.3": "", "ja483:0.4": "", "ja483:1.1": "dr27.361, ms22J_2526, msdiv134, pts-vp-pli4.269", "ja483:1.2": "", "ja483:1.3": "", "ja483:1.4": "", "ja483:2.1": "ms22J_2527, msdiv135", "ja483:2.2": "", "ja483:2.3": "", "ja483:2.4": "", "ja483:3.1": "ms22J_2528, msdiv136, vri68.210", "ja483:3.2": "", "ja483:3.3": "", "ja483:3.4": "", "ja483:4.1": "bj30.472, ms22J_2529, msdiv137, ndp22.265", "ja483:4.2": "", "ja483:4.3": "", "ja483:4.4": "", "ja483:5.1": "ms22J_2530, msdiv138, pts-vp-pli4.270", "ja483:5.2": "", "ja483:5.3": "", "ja483:5.4": "", "ja483:6.1": "csp1ed22.273, csp2ed22.273, ms22J_2531, msdiv139", "ja483:6.2": "", "ja483:6.3": "", "ja483:6.4": "", "ja483:7.1": "ms22J_2532, msdiv140, pts-vp-pli4.271, sya27.363", "ja483:7.2": "", "ja483:7.3": "", "ja483:7.4": "", "ja483:8.1": "dr27.362, ms22J_2533, msdiv141", "ja483:8.2": "", "ja483:8.3": "", "ja483:8.4": "", "ja483:9.1": "ms22J_2534, msdiv142", "ja483:9.2": "", "ja483:9.3": "", "ja483:9.4": "", "ja483:10.1": "ms22J_2535, msdiv143, pts-vp-pli4.272", "ja483:10.2": "", "ja483:10.3": "", "ja483:10.4": "", "ja483:11.1": "ms22J_2536, msdiv144, ndp22.266", "ja483:11.2": "", "ja483:11.3": "", "ja483:11.4": "", "ja483:12.1": "ms22J_2537, msdiv145, pts-vp-pli4.273, sya27.364", "ja483:12.2": "", "ja483:12.3": "", "ja483:12.4": "", "ja483:13.1": "bj30.474, dr27.363, ms22J_2538, msdiv146", "ja483:13.2": "", "ja483:13.3